<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK ONE-WEEK REPO AVERAGE YIELD 74.84 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK ONE-WEEK REPO AVERAGE YIELD 74.84 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in the Czech National Bank's (CNB) one-week repo tender on Monday reached 74.84 percent, after 73.76 percent in the other tender, the CNB said.</p>
<p>The central bank said all bids were accepted at the limit yield of 75 percent.</p>
